#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Unified Power Law Regression – Selective Mode OR Full Sweep Mode

Description:
    This script performs power law regression analysis with two modes:
    - Selective mode: Pick one combination per IM (Cordova, INp, ISa, AvgSa)
    - Sweep mode: Process ALL combinations of ALL FOUR IMs at once

    Features:
    - Supports per-wall total height for y_type = 3 (max roof drift)
    - Heatmaps use fixed colour scales: R²: 0=red, 1=green; σ: 0=green, 1=red
    - Axis labels for sweep heatmaps are parameter-specific (c, α, β, a, b)
    - Individual plots show the correct Y-axis label for all y_types
    - Includes DEBUG output to diagnose R² vs sigma relationship
"""

